<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίμον-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>staying on, lasting
			long</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.43.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖν τὸν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηγόν</span>
			<i>continue</i> him in his command, ib.<i><span class="en">
				15.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμόνους ποιεῖν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐράνους</span>
			<i>delay</i> their payment, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				38.11.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ὦνος ἐ. ἔστω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hermes</u>
					17.5
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Delos</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράτησις ἐπίμονος σπέρματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.43
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινι</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span>
			<i>persevering</i> in it, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				29.26.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Flam.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					3.32
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>
			<i>constantly, permanently</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				372a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.179
			</span></i>; <i>persistently</i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.220
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον</span>”
				<i>more permanently,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gp.
					2.5.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
